<h2 id="who-we-are">1. Who we are, and the two roles we play</h2>

<p>DriveSchoolPro is run by <strong>JOHN POWELL LTD</strong>, company number 05408918, registered in England and Wales, registered office 124 City Road, London, England, EC1V 2NX. "We" and "us" mean JOHN POWELL LTD.</p>

<p>We play two different roles, and which one applies depends on whose data it is.</p>

<p><strong>Where we are the controller.</strong> We decide why and how we use the data about:</p>
<ul>
<li>people who sign up for a DriveSchoolPro account (the owner of a driving school, or a solo instructor) and the staff they invite;</li>
<li>people who visit our website or app, or contact us;</li>
<li>people who receive our own marketing or setup messages.</li>
</ul>

<p><strong>Where we are a processor.</strong> When a driving school or instructor adds a pupil, a parent or other records to DriveSchoolPro, <strong>that school or instructor is the controller</strong> and we process the data for them, on their instructions, under our <a href="/data-processing-terms/">Data Processing Terms</a>. The school decides what to record, why, and for how long it is needed. We do not use pupil data for our own purposes, for advertising or to sell to anyone.</p>

<p><strong>If you are a pupil or a parent:</strong> your driving school or instructor is responsible for your lesson records. Ask them first about your data. If you cannot, email <a href="mailto:privacy@driveschoolpro.com">privacy@driveschoolpro.com</a> and we will pass your request to them. Sections 5 and 11 explain more.</p>

<p>Contact for anything in this notice: <a href="mailto:privacy@driveschoolpro.com"><strong>privacy@driveschoolpro.com</strong></a>. We have not appointed a data protection officer because we are not required to.</p>

